SCOPE: This MIT license covers the SOURCE CODE of Commander In Chief (GDScript
under src/, tools/, tests/, and project configuration). It does NOT grant any
rights to the bundled art, audio, or other assets, which carry their own
separate terms. See ASSETS.md for a complete per-directory provenance and
licensing map, and OPEN_SOURCE_CHECKLIST.md for the outstanding release
blockers.

As of 2026-07-24 every IMAGE in this repository is either owned by the project
(procedurally generated by tools/gen_*.py, or generative-AI art commissioned by
the project) or CC0 (assets/kenney/, assets/fonts/). The previously bundled
legacy art and infantry set pack art has been removed from the working tree.

The bundled AUDIO under assets/vo/ and assets/audio/ is speech synthesis text-to-speech
output. Onward redistribution was confirmed permitted with speech synthesis on
2026-07-24. It is documented in ASSETS.md rather than granted by this file.

⚠️ ONE STEP REMAINS BEFORE PUBLISHING: the previously bundled proprietary art
was removed from the working tree but is still present in this repository's GIT
HISTORY, recoverable from any older commit. Run tools/purge_history.sh before
making the repository public — a working-tree deletion is not sufficient.
